Dear Mattia,

Thank you for RFQ-2026-0244 and apologies for the slight delay - our plant was
in shutdown last week. Please find our indicative offer below for the three
lines you asked about. All prices are in EUR, FCA Milan Malpensa, and hold
until 30 September 2026.

1) Azimax 250 (azithromycin 250 mg film-coated tablets)
   Pack: blister of 6 tablets, 100 packs per shipper
   Price: 0.128 per tablet
   MOQ: 30,000 packs, lead time 6 weeks

2) Zincora 20 (zinc sulfate 20 mg dispersible tablets)
   Pack: 100 tablets per box
   Price: 1.55 per box of 100
   MOQ: 5,000 boxes, lead time 4 weeks
   WHO prequalified (PQ ref. NU003)

3) Dexafar 4 mg/mL (dexamethasone sodium phosphate, solution for injection)
   Pack: 25 x 1 mL ampoules
   Price: 0.41 per ampoule
   MOQ: 2,000 packs, lead time 9 weeks
   Note: this is quoted ex-stock, batch expiring 03/2028

Payment terms 45 days from invoice for Axmed-registered buyers, otherwise
50% advance. Freight and insurance quotable separately once you confirm the
destination port - I assumed Mombasa in the freight estimate we discussed but
the offer above is FCA so it does not include it.

Happy to jump on a call Thursday if useful.

Best regards,

Giulia Ferraro
Export Manager | Novara Farmaceutici S.p.A.
Via dell'Industria 14, 28100 Novara, Italy
T +39 0321 44 91 20 | M +39 335 812 7744
giulia.ferraro@novarafarma.it

P.S. Correction on line 1 - I quoted you last quarter's price. Azimax 250 is
0.134 per tablet as of this month's list. Sorry about that. Lines 2 and 3 are
unchanged.

